      "description": "* WHAT...Southwest winds 30 to 40 mph with gusts up to 65 mph.\n\n* WHERE...Big Island Summits.\n\n* WHEN...Until noon HST today.\n\n* IMPACTS...Winds this strong can make driving and walking dangerous.\nThe winds can forcefully open doors and damage hinges or slam doors\nshut, possibly causing injuries.",
